- **Composition.** His pen runs two animations on two timelines on one element. `body` now does that too: `daylight` (dusk shift) + `stir`, both on `scroll(root)`.
- **Still missing, if you want them:** his masked grid — the squares you cut, but faded diagonally via `mask: linear-gradient(-20deg, transparent 50%, white)`, so they only surface at one corner; and `linear()` spring easing on the draw-ins, which are all plain `linear` right now.

